It is January and it is very cold.
My jacket is thin.
I come out of the flat and go out into the street.
Today is Sunday.
My street is completely quiet.
Supermarkets are closed on Sunday.
Who goes shopping on Sunday?
Me!
I am looking for a gift.
A gift for my family.
A kiosk on the corner is open.
In Berlin, that is a 'Späti'.
A Späti is a small shop.
I walk to the corner.
I want to buy German chocolate.
That is for the video call later.
The Späti is bright and warm.
I open the door and go inside.
